[ti:Success Story]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]
[00:10.09]What was Frank's first job? | 弗兰克的第一份工作是什么？
[00:14.48]Yesterday afternoon Frank Hawkins was telling me about | 昨天下午弗兰克·霍金斯向我讲述了他
[00:19.08]his experiences as a young man. | 年轻时的经历。
[00:23.07]Before he retired, | 在退休前，
[00:25.39]Frank was the head of | 弗兰克是一家
[00:26.96]a very large business company, but as a boy he used to work in a small shop. | 非常大的商业公司的头儿，但他小时候却在一家小铺里做工。
[00:34.44]It was his job to repair bicycles | 他那时的工作是修理自行车
[00:37.50]and at that time he used to work fourteen hours a day. | 并且通常是一天工作14个小时。
[00:42.98]He saved money for years and | 他攒了多年积蓄，
[00:45.37]in 1958 he bought a small workshop of his own. | 在1958年买下了自己的一个小修理铺。
[00:50.77]In his twenties Frank used to make spare parts for aeroplanes. | 二十多岁时，弗兰克曾生产飞机零配件。
[00:56.63]At that time he had two helpers. | 那时他有两个帮手。
[01:00.18]In a few years the small workshop had become a large factory | 几年之后，小铺子已经发展成了一个大工厂，
[01:05.56]which employed seven hundred and twenty-eight people. | 雇用728人。
[01:10.63]Frank smiled when he remembered his hard early years and the long road to success. | 弗兰克回想着他早年的艰难岁月和漫长的成功之路，微笑了。
[01:18.24]He was still smiling when the door opened and his wife came in. | 他正笑着的时候，门开了，他的妻子走了进来。
[01:23.59]She wanted him to repair their grandson's bicycle! | 她叫他去修理他们孙子的自行车！
